REGENT OF BALANGAN SOUTH KALIMANTAN PROVINCE

REGIONAL REGULATION OF BALANGAN REGENCY

NUMBER 3 OF 2016 CONCERNING PROTECTION OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN

FROM ACTS OF VIOLENCE

BY THE GRACE OF GOD ALMIGHTY

REGENT OF BALANGAN,

Considering: a. that every woman and child has the right to obtain protection of their human rights, freedom from torture, threats, pressure, and to receive equal facilities, treatment, opportunities and benefits in order to achieve justice and welfare in life;

b. that improvement of the quality of life of women and children is a mandatory affair which is the responsibility of the Regional Government;

c. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a and letter b, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning Protection of Women from Acts of Violence; In view of 1. Law Number 7 of 1984 concerning

Ratification of the Convention on the Elimination of All Forms of Discrimination Against Women (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1984 Number 29, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3277);

2. Law Number 39 of 1999 concerning Human Rights (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1984 Number 165, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3886);

3. Law Number 23 of 2002 concerning Child Protection (State Gazette of the Republic

Indonesia of 2002 Number 109, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4235) as amended by Law Number 35 of 2014 concerning Amendment to Law Number 23 of 2002 concerning Child Protection; 4. Law Number 2 of 2003 concerning Establishment of Tanah Bumbu Regency and Balangan Regency in South Kalimantan Province (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2003 Number 22, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4265); 5. Law Number 23 of 2004 concerning

Elimination of Domestic Violence (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2004 Number 95, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4419);

6. Law Number 21 of 2007 concerning Eradication of the Criminal Act of Trafficking in Persons (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2003 Number 58, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4720); 7. Law Number 44 of 2008 concerning Pornography (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2008 Number 181, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4928);

8. Law Number 12 of 2011 concerning

Establishment of Legislation (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2011 Number 82, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5234);

